.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Secrets — never commit. .env.example is the tracked template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# .env.production is the deployed build config and is deliberately tracked.
# Every VITE_ value is compiled into the JavaScript bundle and readable by
# anyone in devtools, so none of it can be secret in the first place — keeping
# it in the repo makes the deployed build reproducible instead of depending on
# dashboard state nobody can see. Never put a key or a token in it.
!.env.production
